# Play test of The Arena (CIPlay the_arena, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe ("offset").
# The south plain: the beach trail up from 15 -68, the meadow levelled at 3.5 m round the great canopy (15 -38), the ring of
# plates 12 m round it, the rules at 15 -55; the lake x -36..-8 z -55..-33 with its islet (-22 -44); the lean-to at
# -50 -30; the control room in the south-west peak's east flank (floor 7 m, x -10..-4 z -27..-15, its door at -4 -24
# opening on a cutting down to the meadow); the champion in the valley at 15 -17.
island The Arena
offset 0.4541 0.9109
expect step 0
expect title The Games Run On
wait 5
expect animals Goat 3
expect animals Dolphin 2

# Up from the beach: the shore, a sponsor's gift in a hollow, the rules at the meadow's edge
walk 15 -72 to 15 -66 to 15 -63 h=3
zone shore
expect step 1
open Sponsor's gift by the trail
walk 15 -62 to 15 -57 h=3.5
read Rules of the Arena
expect step 2

# Onto a plate: round one, the boars; the canopy's crate
walk 15 -56 to 13.5 -52 to 12.5 -48.5 h=3.5
zone ring
expect step 3
expect shown round1
open Canopy supply crate
expect message The crate is chained
kill Warthog
expect step 4
open Canopy supply crate
expect step 5

# Round the lake's south shore to the lean-to in the woods: the diary, Pia's box
walk 15 -50 to 5 -58 to -10 -60 to -25 -60 to -40 -54 to -48 -44 to -50 -35 to -50 -32 h=3
read A contestant's diary
expect step 6
open Lean-to box

# Round two: the hounds
wait 5
expect shown round2
kill Hyena
expect step 7
expect shown supplydrop

# Out to the islet: the last gift and the warden's pass; the final round
at -22 -41 h=1.5
zone islet
open Supply drop
expect story wardenpass 1
expect step 8
wait 10
expect shown champion
kill Bear
expect step 9

# Up the cutting to the door in the peak; the control room
walk 13 -24 to 6 -24 to 0 -24 to -3 -24 h=7
walk -3 -24 to -5 -23 to -6 -21 h=7
zone controlroom
expect step 10
read Gamewarden's log
expect step 11
use console
expect story prizekey 1
expect step 12
open Prize vault
wait 2
expect done

# The other gifts: on the upland, sunk in the lake
open Sponsor's gift on the upland
open Sunk gift
